<title>NETHERLANDS: Stad Rotterdam 1996 profit DFl 156.9 mln.</title>
<headline>Stad Rotterdam 1996 profit DFl 156.9 mln.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year 1996 to end-December</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     4.99 vs   4.39</p>
<p>    Net profit			   156.9  vs 133.4</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  2.38 vs   2.10</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had expected Stad Rotterdam to report a net profit of 153 million to 157 million guilders.</p>
</text>
